description	"Reelo Baruk

A criminal kingpin armed to the teeth with weapons of dubious legality.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee (Wookiee-style)
-- 10% slower RoF
- Overcharged E-11 Blaster Rifle (2)
-- 15% faster RoF
-- Secondary fire only
- Tenloss DXR-6 Disruptor Rifle (2)
- Carbonite Rifle (Icethrower)
-- 100% slower mag reload
- Overcharged PLX-2M Rocket Launcher (10)
-- Pushes on det
-- 70% faster RoF
-- 40% less damage
-- 100% slower reload
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Trip Mines (2)
- Pulse Grenades (2)

^6Inventory:
- Portable E-Web Cannon ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- 25% more knockback given
- 50% less knockback taken
- 50% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]"